&lt;p style="margin-left: 120px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;２．親会社又は重要な関連会社に関する注記&lt;/p&gt;
